{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CSB6nvyJJgNbK8Qm6B8hb2","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (174.9KB). Full output saved to: /Users/davidbean/.claude/projects/-Users-davidbean-Projects-attavo-worktree-158/6a170d87-3d29-46e3-a1eb-69574ae98490/tool-results/bd8q7v4ql.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\n=== attest/specs/158/stub/.attavo/bin/forge-attestation ===\n#!/bin/sh\nread sha\ntest -n \"$sha\" || exit 2\ndigest=$(printf '%s' \"$sha\" | shasum -a 256 | cut -d ' ' -f 1)\nrepo=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner --jq .nameWithOwner 2>/dev/null) || exit 2\npayload=$(gh api \"repos/$repo/attestations/sha256:$digest\" --jq '.attestations[0].bundle.dsseEnvelope.payload' 2>/dev/null) || exit 1\ntest -n \"$payload\" && test \"$payload\" != null || exit 1\nprintf '%s' \"$payload\" | base64 -d\n\n=== attest/specs/158/stub/attavo.toml ===\nschema_version = 1\n\n[attavo]\nversion = \"v0.25.0\"\n\n[forge]\nattestation_command = \"sh .attavo/bin/forge-attestation\"\nsealed_since = \"83fcbc6863fd\"\nchecks_command = \"python3 .attavo/bin/forge-checks\"\nfile_issue_command = \"python3 .attavo/bin/file-issue\"\n\n[executor]\nbuild = \"claude-code\"\nverify = \"codex\"\n\n[executor.claude-code]\nauth = \"subscription\"\nmodel = \"claude-sonnet-5\"\n\n[executor.codex]\nmodel = \"gpt-5.6-sol\"\n\n[spec]\n[spec.boundary]\npaths = [\"bin/**\", \"adapters/**\", \"schema/**\", \"templates/**\", \"action.yml\", \"scripts/**\"]\n\n[gates]\n[gates.spec]\ncommand = \"attavo spec-gate\"\nretires = [\n  \"the lane as the product's transport: a Claude Code lane session reporting to a reviewing session, with no spec, no approval bound to a commit, no build/verify separation, and no attestation on the product's own commits\",\n  \"the || true step in ci.yml that ran the doctor's four proofs against this repository expected to still fail\",\n  \"the reviewing session as the reader of whether the lane did what the issue said\",\n]